---
title: GitOps Reconciliation Loop
---
graph TB
    subgraph Git ["📁 Git Repository (Source of Truth)"]
        A[k8s/overlays/dev\nkustomization.yaml\nimage: backend:a1b2c3d]
    end

    subgraph ArgoCD ["🔄 ArgoCD Controller"]
        B[Compare\nDesired State vs Actual State]
        C{Drift\nDetected?}
        D[Reconcile\nkubectl apply]
        E[Report: Synced ✅]
        F[Report: OutOfSync ⚠️\nAutoSync ON → apply\nAutoSync OFF → alert]
    end

    subgraph K8s ["☸️ Kubernetes Cluster"]
        G[Actual State\nDeployment: backend\nimage: backend:a1b2c3d]
        H[Rolling Update\nnew pods created\nold pods terminated]
        I[Healthy Pods\nreadiness probe passes]
    end

    subgraph CI ["⚙️ GitHub Actions"]
        J[Build & Push\nbackend:b2c3d4e]
        K[Update Manifest\nkustomize edit set image]
        L[Git Push\nchore: update dev to b2c3d4e]
    end

    subgraph Dev ["👨‍💻 Developer"]
        M[git push main]
    end

    M --> CI
    L --> A
    A -->|Poll every 3 min| B
    B --> C
    C -->|No| E
    C -->|Yes| F
    F -->|selfHeal: true| D
    D --> H
    H --> I
    I --> G
    G -->|Reports actual state| B

    style Git fill:#1e3a5f,color:#93c5fd
    style ArgoCD fill:#312e81,color:#a5b4fc
    style K8s fill:#064e3b,color:#6ee7b7
    style CI fill:#422006,color:#fcd34d
    style Dev fill:#3b0764,color:#e9d5ff
